{"id":"d187832140588471f267c38b168525f2ae84ab38","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1244029","title":"Codex 是不是大部分不复杂的需求用 GPT-5.6 Luna 就够了？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"vruzo","excerpt":"问与答 - @vruzo - 之前习惯性地用 Sol 中，5 小时额度很快就没了，最近开始用 Luna，发现特别耐用，改一些 bug 也都没问题","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18116317\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/71ca9bdb94e7304de5f65e6eb9f86a98?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"w9in2er\" data-uid=\"541720\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/w9in2er\">w9in2er</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-22 18:06:37 +08:00\">1 day ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>一直用 luna 。用不起其他的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18116335\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/aa5a/be42/46426_normal.png?m=1786111803\" alt=\"ffalex\" data-uid=\"46426\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ffalex\">ffalex</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-22 18:09:34 +08:00\">1 day ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>但 luna 很慢</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18116336\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d30b/8fb4/90818_normal.png?m=1720835206\" alt=\"panlatent\" data-uid=\"90818\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/panlatent\">panlatent</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-22 18:09:41 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>个人体验来讲，Luna 有点傻，但傻的不明显，耐蹬。Sol 一般也就够蹬 2 个（中型）任务，Plus 没资格用 Sol = =！。 所以现在 Sol 讨论，Luna&amp;国内模型干活</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18116354\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cb7e/d3ff/714531_normal.png?m=1761119463\" alt=\"V2Try\" data-uid=\"714531\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/V2Try\">V2Try</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-22 18:19:46 +08:00\">1 day ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>luna 必须 high 起步，用 medium 就像个傻逼一样，让它照着写好的 chrome 扩展写一个 firefox 的，搞完全是报错</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18116365\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/950278cf5f637f3f0ddc116601e93969?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"nsjs\" data-uid=\"507787\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/nsjs\">nsjs</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-22 18:26:03 +08:00\">23h 59m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>看你任务复杂度呗。一般只是单模块内就还好，涉及到跨模块，生命周期，边界场景经常会漏</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18116367\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/66748d23889d3c60a24a6c972f2f1d79?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"K332\" data-uid=\"640934\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/K332\">K332</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-22 18:26:53 +08:00\">23h 58m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>luna 只开 max ，效果还行，就是慢了些，额度不够时用这个可以撑到重置</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18116797\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8687/1447/404080_normal.png?m=1784722393\" alt=\"labubu\" data-uid=\"404080\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/labubu\">labubu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-22 22:03:33 +08:00\">20h 22m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>网页 sol 聊天，聊好了让它出详细出方案给 luna max 执行就可以了，开目标模式</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18116808\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/09069d134d28763cbeccac8b2e9fff3e?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"afkool\" data-uid=\"546565\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/afkool\">afkool</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-22 22:08:39 +08:00\">20h 16m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>写代码肯定不行。。整点翻译、写点 skill 差不多够用。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18116862\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b67f/7398/269646_normal.png?m=1751523461\" alt=\"Helsing\" data-uid=\"269646\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Helsing\">Helsing</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-22 22:51:50 +08:00\">19h 33m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>sol high 写 plan ，luna high 执行</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18116894\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cdbd/e53b/200291_normal.png?m=1494895192\" alt=\"badreamm\" data-uid=\"200291\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/badreamm\">badreamm</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-22 23:21:56 +08:00\">19h 3m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>之前一直用 luna max ，这两天像弱智一样</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18117116\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c72a/cf0f/78954_normal.png?m=1699319258\" alt=\"wzw\" data-uid=\"78954\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wzw\">wzw</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-23 07:16:52 +08:00\">11h 8m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    \n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18117173\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/e4b42ff48cb2a2c3e5e22ff67fb9abcd?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"d